      "content": [
        {
          "type": "tool_result",
          "tool_use_id": "toolu_01U3LfLYLC8dULorKNocm5Mz",
          "content": "[{\"target\":\"/Context_Library\",\"action\":\"view\",\"ok\":true,\"message\":\"• /Context_Library (map, 3 keys) — Knowledge base topics organized hierarchically. Browse by viewing topics and their subtopics. Each topic may contain educational content and/or nested subtopics. \\\\n  - Articles on Rett Syndrome: {object}\\\\n      - id: \\\"24ea3fdc-ff95-40ec-8db8-b26e11db6a40\\\" — Topic UUID (for internal reference)\\\\n      - title: \\\"Articles on Rett Syndrome\\\" — Topic title\\\\n      - content: \\\"A comprehensive list of articles on Rett Syndrome by Prof. Meir Lotan\\\\nOverview\\\\nProf. Meir Lotan, a physiotherapist and senior researcher at Ariel University, is one of the world's leading experts in the field of Rett Syndrome treatment with over 30 years of clinical and research experience. His scientific output includes 38 focused articles on Rett Syndrome with over 1,200 citations in total, indicating his significant influence in this field.\\\" — Topic content - knowledge base text for AI reference. May be empty if topic is just a category.\\\\n      - subtopics: {map} — Nested subtopics under this topic. View to see available subtopics. \\\\n          (may contain items - view \\\"/Context_Library/Articles on Rett Syndrome/subtopics\\\" to load from database)\\\\n      ↪ To expand: view \\\"/Context_Library/Articles on Rett Syndrome/*\\\". (read-only)\\\\n  - Physiotherapy Goals - Gross Motor Skills: {object}\\\\n      - id: \\\"f0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\\\" — Topic UUID (for internal reference)\\\\n      - title: \\\"Physiotherapy Goals - Gross Motor Skills\\\" — Topic title\\\\n      - content: \\\"Individual Physiotherapy Learning Plans (תוכנית לימוד אישית - פיזיותרפיה) for pediatric gross motor development. These structured therapy goal templates are used in Israeli special education (TALA) settings for children with motor development needs. Each goal includes: Long-term objectives, intervention methods, prerequisites/conditions, success criteria, and designated implementers (physiotherapist and/or educational team).\\\" — Topic content - knowledge base text for AI reference. May be empty if topic is just a category.\\\\n      - subtopics: {map} — Nested subtopics under this topic. View to see available subtopics. \\\\n          (may contain items - view \\\"/Context_Library/Physiotherapy Goals - Gross Motor Skills/subtopics\\\" to load from database)\\\\n      ↪ To expand: view \\\"/Context_Library/Physiotherapy Goals - Gross Motor Skills/*\\\". (read-only)\\\\n  - Preschool SLP Goals Bank: {object}\\\\n      - id: \\\"1ab6aeb0-36fd-4875-bda3-1c100f3c6446\\\" — Topic UUID (for internal reference)\\\\n      - title: \\\"Preschool SLP Goals Bank\\\" — Topic title\\\\n      - content: \\\"Preschool SLP Goals Bank\\\" — Topic content - knowledge base text for AI reference. May be empty if topic is just a category.\\\\n      - subtopics: {map} — Nested subtopics under this topic. View to see available subtopics. \\\\n          (may contain items - view \\\"/Context_Library/Preschool SLP Goals Bank/subtopics\\\" to load from database)\\\\n      ↪ To expand: view \\\"/Context_Library/Preschool SLP Goals Bank/*\\\". (read-only)\",\"mutatedPaths\":[\"/Context_Library\"],\"summary\":\"3 item(s): Articles on Rett Syndrome, Physiotherapy Goals - Gross Motor Skills, Preschool SLP Goals Bank\"}]"
